  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "General corrosion produced the hole in the station roof drain line which is located overhead of the 6.9kV Unit Board 2C. The hole allowed moisture to intrude into the top of the board and thus, into the cubicle for the alternate feeder circuit breaker to the 6.9kV Unit Board 2C. The moisture intrusion resulted in an electrical fault producing a differential relay actuation.",
    "cause_code": "A",
    "category": "Personnel Error",
    "theme": "inadequate roof drain maintenance/inspection allowed corrosion-induced leak onto electrical equipment",
    "provisional": false
  },
